00:17:09,471 --> 00:17:10,638
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mister and Lady.</font>

405
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:13,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tungee!</font>

406
00:17:13,180 --> 00:17:15,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">♪ Mister and Lady. ♪</font>

407
00:17:15,597 --> 00:17:16,638
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tungee!</font>

408
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:17,889
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tungee!</font>

409
00:17:17,930 --> 00:17:20,221
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mister and Lady in robot voice.</font>

410
00:17:20,263 --> 00:17:21,847
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tungee!</font>

411
00:17:23,305 --> 00:17:24,248
<font color="#FFFFFF">Run-jay!</font>

412
00:17:24,263 --> 00:17:26,722
<font color="#FFFFFF">Aah, Mister and Lady!</font>

413
00:17:28,346 --> 00:17:29,722
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Tungee!
Tungee!</font>

414
00:17:29,763 --> 00:17:31,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Mister and Lady.</font>

415
00:17:31,972 --> 00:17:34,763
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Tungee,
we missed you so much!</font>

416
00:17:34,805 --> 00:17:38,014
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's go home.</font>

417
00:17:41,555 --> 00:17:43,388
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tungee, we're
so sorry.</font>

418
00:17:43,430 --> 00:17:44,763
<font color="#FFFFFF">You must have
been so scared.</font>

419
00:17:44,805 --> 00:17:48,263
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, we're never going
to leave you again, ever.</font>

420
00:17:48,305 --> 00:17:50,346
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I never want to leave you,</font>

421
00:17:50,388 --> 00:17:54,638
<font color="#FFFFFF">the most generous,
wonderful people I have ever…</font>

422
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ugh, this guy.</font>

423
00:17:55,972 --> 00:17:59,430
<font color="#FFFFFF">I forgot how much
he sucked.</font>

424
00:17:59,471 --> 00:18:00,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">Should we?</font>

425
00:18:00,513 --> 00:18:02,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't think
we have a choice.</font>

426
00:18:02,180 --> 00:18:05,263
<font color="#FFFFFF">One, two. Three.</font>

427
00:18:11,847 --> 00:18:13,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">I miss him.</font>

428
00:18:13,139 --> 00:18:14,221
<font color="#FFFFFF">Me, too.</font>

429
00:18:22,180 --> 00:18:25,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on, little guy, we have to
stop Ricky before it's too late.</font>

430
00:18:26,014 --> 00:18:28,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, finish up while I go
plant some sweaters on Steve.</font>

431
00:18:28,847 --> 00:18:29,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why would
you do that?</font>

432
00:18:29,972 --> 00:18:31,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">So when the guards find
Steve on the boat,</font>

433
00:18:31,972 --> 00:18:34,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">they'll think he's the one
who stole the shipment.</font>

434
00:18:34,180 --> 00:18:35,722
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why did I waste my time</font>

435
00:18:35,763 --> 00:18:37,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">reading you all
those Nancy Drews?</font>

436
00:18:37,513 --> 00:18:38,638
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ricky!</font>

437
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:39,722
<font color="#FFFFFF">What the Dickens?</font>

438
00:18:39,763 --> 00:18:41,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">I thought you knocked
him out, Daniel.</font>

439
00:18:41,346 --> 00:18:42,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">What the Dickens?</font>

440
00:18:42,513 --> 00:18:44,014
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ricky, don't do this.</font>

441
00:18:44,055 --> 00:18:45,763
<font color="#FFFFFF">You can still be good,
I know it.</font>

442
00:18:45,805 --> 00:18:47,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry, Steve,</font>

443
00:18:47,221 --> 00:18:49,346
<font color="#FFFFFF">some people are just bad
and they always will be.</font>

444
00:18:49,388 --> 00:18:51,263
<font color="#FFFFFF">Grab him, Daniel.
Come here.</font>

445
00:18:57,139 --> 00:18:58,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shh, keep it down.</font>

446
00:18:58,555 --> 00:18:59,722
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey!</font>

447
00:18:59,763 --> 00:19:01,097
<font color="#FFFFFF">Run for it!</font>

448
00:19:04,055 --> 00:19:05,555
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're gaining
on us.</font>

449
00:19:17,597 --> 00:19:19,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ricky, help!</font>

450
00:19:19,097 --> 00:19:21,263
<font color="#FFFFFF">I believe in you.</font>

451
00:19:21,305 --> 00:19:23,889
<font color="#FFFFFF">You are
a butterfly!</font>

452
00:19:25,889 --> 00:19:27,388
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, God!</font>

453
00:19:29,555 --> 00:19:30,930
<font color="#FFFFFF">You came back for me.</font>

454
00:19:30,972 --> 00:19:32,180
<font color="#FFFFFF">I knew you changed.</font>

455
00:19:32,221 --> 00:19:34,388
<font color="#FFFFFF">I knew you… aah…!</font>

456
00:19:43,014 --> 00:19:45,305
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ow, ow, ow!</font>

457
00:19:46,346 --> 00:19:47,346
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!</font>

458
00:20:12,263 --> 00:20:15,680
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kill. You.
Ricky. Spanish.</font>

459
00:20:15,722 --> 00:20:17,680
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Two beautiful creatures</i></font>

460
00:20:17,722 --> 00:20:20,471
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>trapped in a prison
of another's design</i></font>

461
00:20:20,513 --> 00:20:23,722
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>like a madman
lost in a supermarket.</i></font>

462
00:20:23,805 --> 00:20:28,555
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>One is freed while the other
dies alone in a glass tomb,</i></font>

463
00:20:28,597 --> 00:20:31,180
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>which used to contain farts.</i></font>

464
00:20:31,221 --> 00:20:33,221
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Perhaps it is fitting,</i></font>

465
00:20:33,263 --> 00:20:36,847
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>for what was the butterfly
other than a symbol</i></font>

466
00:20:36,889 --> 00:20:41,471
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>of the boy's innocence
that perished days before,</i></font>

467
00:20:41,513 --> 00:20:46,263
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>killed by the very soul
he tried to save?</i></font>

468
00:20:46,305 --> 00:20:49,221
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Ricky Spanish.</i></font>

469
00:21:25,055 --> 00:21:27,014
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bye! Have a beautiful time.</font>

470
00:21:27,139 --> 00:21:28,221
<font color="#FFFFFF">Captioned by Point.360</font>

